        "q1": {"type": "faq_item", "settings": {"question": "What's your return policy?", "answer": "<p>You have 60 days to try the Neck Relax at home. If it's not for you, send it back for a full refund — we cover return shipping.</p>"}},
        "q2": {"type": "faq_item", "settings": {"question": "What's covered under warranty?", "answer": "<p>Every Neck Relax comes with a 1-year hardware warranty covering manufacturing defects.</p>"}},
        "q3": {"type": "faq_item", "settings": {"question": "How does it work?", "answer": "<p>The Neck Relax combines constant 42°C heat, 4-node vibration massage, low-frequency pulse modes, and a soft red light glow in one wireless, hands-free wrap.</p>"}},
        "q4": {"type": "faq_item", "settings": {"question": "Is it safe for daily use?", "answer": "<p>The device is FCC, CE, and RoHS certified for safety, and designed for comfortable daily wear.</p>"}},
        "q5": {"type": "faq_item", "settings": {"question": "How do I charge it?", "answer": "<p>It charges via USB-C — no proprietary cable required.</p>"}},
        "q6": {"type": "faq_item", "settings": {"question": "How do I clean it?", "answer": "<p>Wipe the strap and device with a soft, dry cloth. Avoid submerging it in water.</p>"}}
